flowchart TD
    A[Ambiguous problem surfaces] --> B[Frame the problem and constraints]
    B --> C[Draft options, including a deliberately simple baseline]
    C --> D[Write it down: RFC or ADR draft]
    D --> E{Reversible? Type 1 vs Type 2}
    E -->|Type 2, reversible| F[Async written review]
    E -->|Type 1, hard to reverse| G[Synchronous design review]
    F --> H[Decision recorded with consequences]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Implementation]
    I --> J[Revisit trigger defined up front]
    J -->|Trigger fires| B
